# EXP-40: Decision Tree to ARFF, Rule Induction & Confusion Matrix in WEKA

======================================================================
  EXPERIMENT 40: DECISION TREE TO ARFF & RULE INDUCTION IN WEKA
======================================================================

1. OBJECTIVE:
   To create an ARFF dataset for height/weight gender classification and induce 
   decision rules using J48 and PART classifiers in WEKA.

2. WEKA ARFF DATASET (person_gender_exp40.arff):
----------------------------------------------------------------------
@relation person_gender_tree

@attribute Height numeric
@attribute Weight numeric
@attribute Gender {Male, Female}

@data
185, 75, Male
175, 85, Male
170, 60, Female
182, 90, Male
165, 55, Female
178, 82, Male
190, 70, Male
160, 50, Female
172, 65, Female
188, 95, Male
----------------------------------------------------------------------

3. WEKA J48 OUTPUT & INDUCED RULES:
======================================================================
=== J48 Pruned Tree ===
Height > 180: Male (4.0)
Height <= 180
|   Weight > 80: Male (2.0)
|   Weight <= 80: Female (4.0)

Induced Rules:
 Rule 1: IF Height > 180 THEN Gender = Male
 Rule 2: IF Height <= 180 AND Weight > 80 THEN Gender = Male
 Rule 3: IF Height <= 180 AND Weight <= 80 THEN Gender = Female

Correctly Classified Instances: 10 / 10 (100.00 %)
======================================================================
